E AX3064 1071-mutex-guard-sealed.ax:34:39-40 parallel-capture "a concurrent binding captures `g`, which has type `MutexGuard` - a handle its module did not declare `shared`" #"`g` is bound outside this binding" !"MM-PAR-6: a word struct crosses into a concurrent binding only when its module declares it `shared`, which says every operation on it is safe from several bindings at once; `__proc_spawn` names the isolated lowering and is exempt" ?"use the handle only in the binding that holds it, or have its module declare `(struct MutexGuard word shared ...)` if every operation on it is safe from several bindings at once"
